--- title
# Chris Cleaner

--- body
Desktop disk analysis, file indexing and cleanup tools with native filesystem integration.

--- actions
[Product](https://christiansoftware.org/) · [Portfolio](/en/#products)
:::

::: section architecture
## Architecture

Chris Cleaner is a desktop application divided into presentation, file-analysis services and local catalog storage.

- **Desktop interface:** dashboards, file listings, filters and user operations.
- **File discovery:** directory enumeration and collection of filesystem metadata.
- **Catalog:** local file indexing, scan checkpoints and incremental updates.
- **Background execution:** asynchronous scanning and task processing.
- **Platform adapters:** Windows filesystem integration and operating-system-specific services.
- **Cleanup:** separate services for identified file categories and cleanup operations.

The application maintains a local catalog for browsing and analyzing results of filesystem scans.
:::

::: section technologies
## Technologies

- **Desktop:** C#, .NET 8, Avalonia UI.
- **Presentation model:** CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.
- **Local database:** LiteDB.
- **Background services:** .NET hosting, asynchronous tasks and channels.
- **Native filesystem:** NTFS metadata and USN Journal integration on Windows.
:::

